    Activate the new environment
    e.g. source slipstream/bin/activate

2. Configure SSO on terminal window
    Run: aws configure sso - follow on sceeen prompts
        When prompted, bring up local browser and set URL to that indicated on terminal window
        Enter code from terminal onto browser screen
        Hit enter  - ensure that the code matches what you see on terminal
        Hit enter

3. On terminal
        Enter Account you wish to access (Sandbox)
        Use Devloper-Pipeline-PS role
4. From SSO (Web), copy role credentials and paste it into ~/.aws/credentials
        run: git clone codecommit://<role>@<repo>

